<</CreationDate(D:20100428092605+01'00')/Subject(A memory cell structure \(10\) includes a plurality of bit lines \(12\) and intersecting word lines \(14\). Bit line contacts \(16\) are spaced evenly apart on an associated bit line \(12\). A plurality of storage nodes \(20\) and associated storage node \
contacts \(18\) are provided. Storage nodes \(20\) and storage node contacts \(2\) are spaced evenly apart along the associated bit line \(12\). The storage nodes \(20\) and storage node contacts \(18\) are offset with respect to storage nodes \(20\) and \
storage node contacts \(18\) placed along adjacent bit lines \(12\). [image])/PDFVersion(1.4)/Creator(Jouve S.A., TaggedPDF v1.27)/Keywords("EP0967652"; "EP 0967652"; "H01L 27/108"; "DRAM cell array layout")/Producer(Adobe PDF Library 8.0)/ModDate(D:20100710175237+02'00')/Title(DRAM cell array layout - European Patent Office - EP 0967652 A1)>>
